---
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
import { evidenceStats, PREPARED } from "@/lib/model";

const e = evidenceStats();
---

<Base title="About & method" description="How the flyway model works and how it is checked.">
	<h1>About</h1>
	<p style="max-width:60ch">
		Each species has one or more populations with a wintering ground, a breeding ground and a route. Positions follow
		the calendar; live sightings from iNaturalist, GBIF and (with your own key) eBird are filtered to the matching flyway
		and compared with where the model says birds should be.
	</p>
	<h2>Audit</h2>
	<p>
		{PREPARED.length} species, {e.total} grounds. {e.checked} had enough GBIF records to check; {e.good} show clear
		seasonality matching the model. Re-run with <code>bun run audit</code>.
	</p>
</Base>
